#: ../../source/docs/common-topotek-gimbal.rst:7
#: 9d87b05d36b7417fa99d8b99c7380770
msgid "Topotek Gimbals"
msgstr "Topotek 云台"

#: ../../source/docs/common-topotek-gimbal.rst:9
#: 5ee85a9b7c9a42b1bacec946268375ca
msgid ""
"`Topotek <https://topotek.com/>`__ provides a wide variety of camera gimbals"
" which communicate with ArduPilot using a custom serial protocol. The "
"smallest is the `GIP335 <https://topotek.com/gip335-gip335-2k-ultra-"
"lightweight-network-gimbal-camera-p5888810.html>`__  which weighs 60g"
msgstr ""
"`Topotek <https://topotek.com/>`__ 提供多种摄像头云台，通过自定义串口协议与 ArduPilot 通信。最小型号为 "
"`GIP335 <https://topotek.com/gip335-gip335-2k-ultra-lightweight-network-"
"gimbal-camera-p5888810.html>`__，重量仅 60g"

#: ../../source/docs/common-topotek-gimbal.rst:17
#: 3818b60bda6e486a9c025b0892620400
msgid "Support for these gimbals is available in ArduPilot 4.6 (and higher)"
msgstr "ArduPilot 4.6（及更高版本）支持这些云台"

#: ../../source/docs/common-topotek-gimbal.rst:21
#: e436913d995b4fc186ff8f3d7a5c569d
msgid "Where to Buy"
msgstr "购买渠道"

#: ../../source/docs/common-topotek-gimbal.rst:23
#: dd9d611c9cae4fa9835f5af7ba431433
msgid ""
"These gimbals can be purchased directly from `Topotek "
"<https://topotek.com/>`__"
msgstr "这些云台可直接从 `Topotek <https://topotek.com/>`__ 购买"

#: ../../source/docs/common-topotek-gimbal.rst:26
#: 807d3e348e6c4eeaaba32caca6e42f1f
msgid "Connecting to the Autopilot"
msgstr "连接到飞控"

#: ../../source/docs/common-topotek-gimbal.rst:32
#: 6e193b33d7f144f1918053217f0dac2a
msgid ""
"Connect the gimbal's RX, TX and GND pins to one of the autopilot's serial "
"ports as shown above."
msgstr "如上图所示，将云台的 RX、TX 和 GND 引脚连接到飞控的某个串口。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-topotek-gimbal.rst:34
#: e7b0e961430c410ea4dccd5571e9e765
msgid ""
"Connect with a ground station and set the following parameters.  The params "
"below assume the autopilot's telem2 port is used and the Camera1 control "
"instance,"
msgstr "连接地面站并设置以下参数。以下参数假设使用飞控的 telem2 端口和 Camera1 控制实例，"

#: ../../source/docs/common-topotek-gimbal.rst:36
#: 11e0fbb80d14499da3ba49af9887f78f
msgid ":ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL <SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` to 8 (\"Gimbal\")"
msgstr ":ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL <SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` 设为 8（「Gimbal」）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-topotek-gimbal.rst:37
#: 0e6a8ecb9cbe4475ad30c16e1a2d9329
msgid ":ref:`SERIAL2_BAUD <SERIAL2_BAUD>` to \"115\" for 115200 bps"
msgstr ":ref:`SERIAL2_BAUD <SERIAL2_BAUD>` 设为 「115」（115200 bps）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-topotek-gimbal.rst:38
#: f0c18f1bf86243d4a7b211bb0b54f785
msgid ":ref:`MNT1_TYPE <MNT1_TYPE>` to \"12\" (\"Topotek\") and reboot the autopilot"
msgstr ":ref:`MNT1_TYPE <MNT1_TYPE>` 设为 「12」（「Topotek」）并重启飞控"

#: ../../source/docs/common-topotek-gimbal.rst:39
#: 196eff32d9ba4dc1830489b14883dd76
msgid ":ref:`MNT1_PITCH_MIN <MNT1_PITCH_MIN>` to -90"
msgstr ":ref:`MNT1_PITCH_MIN <MNT1_PITCH_MIN>` 设为 -90"

#: ../../source/docs/common-topotek-gimbal.rst:40
#: c8b5047ea9f84cb4a57bb346329e0365
msgid ":ref:`MNT1_PITCH_MAX <MNT1_PITCH_MAX>` to 45"
msgstr ":ref:`MNT1_PITCH_MAX <MNT1_PITCH_MAX>` 设为 45"

#: ../../source/docs/common-topotek-gimbal.rst:41
#: 8cd8b21a9ec746178e0cb38190c6068c
msgid ":ref:`MNT1_YAW_MIN <MNT1_YAW_MIN>` to -180"
msgstr ":ref:`MNT1_YAW_MIN <MNT1_YAW_MIN>` 设为 -180"

#: ../../source/docs/common-topotek-gimbal.rst:42
#: f62f1ad049ee41d5b77ca5d5096c2ef6
msgid ":ref:`MNT1_YAW_MAX <MNT1_YAW_MAX>` to 180"
msgstr ":ref:`MNT1_YAW_MAX <MNT1_YAW_MAX>` 设为 180"

#: ../../source/docs/common-topotek-gimbal.rst:43
#: 5bb60efb40eb4b33b650cfe5aa04dece
msgid ""
":ref:`MNT1_RC_RATE <MNT1_RC_RATE>` to 60 (deg/s) to control speed of gimbal "
"when using RC targetting"
msgstr ":ref:`MNT1_RC_RATE <MNT1_RC_RATE>` 设为 60（度/秒），用于控制使用 RC 目标跟踪时云台的旋转速度"

#: ../../source/docs/common-topotek-gimbal.rst:44
#: 23683eb64f884eb3bffda0e6ef0891f7
msgid ""
":ref:`CAM1_TYPE<CAM1_TYPE>` to 4 / \"Mount\" to allow control of the camera"
msgstr ":ref:`CAM1_TYPE<CAM1_TYPE>` 设为 4 / 「Mount」，以允许控制相机"

#: ../../source/docs/common-topotek-gimbal.rst:45
#: 54421368b419480d857d50df7daf726a
msgid ""
":ref:`RC6_OPTION <RC6_OPTION>` = 213 (\"Mount Pitch\") to control the "
"gimbal's pitch angle with RC channel 6"
msgstr ""
":ref:`RC6_OPTION <RC6_OPTION>` = 213（「Mount Pitch」），使用 RC 通道 6 控制云台俯仰角"

#: ../../source/docs/common-topotek-gimbal.rst:46
#: 0a461f593b5d40b089b39942c0458a7e
msgid ""
":ref:`RC7_OPTION <RC7_OPTION>` = 214 (\"Mount Yaw\") to control the gimbal's"
" yaw angle with RC channel 7"
msgstr ":ref:`RC7_OPTION <RC7_OPTION>` = 214（「Mount Yaw」），使用 RC 通道 7 控制云台偏航角"

#: ../../source/docs/common-topotek-gimbal.rst:47
#: 4b2b3031562343db873f069edbb5b27b
msgid ""
":ref:`RC8_OPTION <RC8_OPTION>` = 163 (\"Mount Lock\") to switch between "
"\"lock\" and \"follow\" mode with RC channel 8"
msgstr ""
":ref:`RC8_OPTION <RC8_OPTION>` = 163（「Mount Lock」），使用 RC 通道 8 "
"在「锁定」和「跟随」模式之间切换"

#: ../../source/docs/common-topotek-gimbal.rst:49
#: 2817378a2d1f448ca2ccb599dc51e682
msgid "Optionally these auxiliary functions are also available"
msgstr "以下辅助功能也可选用"

#: ../../source/docs/common-topotek-gimbal.rst:51
#: 37131d04afe2477e9d908e2ba855aaba
msgid ":ref:`RC9_OPTION <RC9_OPTION>` = 9 (\"Camera Trigger\") to take a picture"
msgstr ":ref:`RC9_OPTION <RC9_OPTION>` = 9（「Camera Trigger」）拍照"

#: ../../source/docs/common-topotek-gimbal.rst:52
#: 4bfc321d1ac948339708b0789a3713b5
msgid ""
":ref:`RC9_OPTION <RC9_OPTION>` = 166 (\"Camera Record Video\") to start/stop"
" recording of video"
msgstr ":ref:`RC9_OPTION <RC9_OPTION>` = 166（「Camera Record Video」）开始/停止录像"

#: ../../source/docs/common-topotek-gimbal.rst:53
#: b54c0be0c303482fbb96bb28167a5b7d
msgid ":ref:`RC9_OPTION <RC9_OPTION>` = 167 (\"Camera Zoom\") to zoom in and out"
msgstr ":ref:`RC9_OPTION <RC9_OPTION>` = 167（「Camera Zoom」）放大/缩小"

#: ../../source/docs/common-topotek-gimbal.rst:54
#: 7baa2cac1b01493f8dfc47518c90beba
msgid ""
":ref:`RC9_OPTION <RC9_OPTION>` = 168 (\"Camera Manual Focus\") to adjust "
"focus in and out"
msgstr ":ref:`RC9_OPTION <RC9_OPTION>` = 168（「Camera Manual Focus」）手动调节对焦"

#: ../../source/docs/common-topotek-gimbal.rst:55
#: d2fcee1cded84c0eb586c1b0b5aef1c9
msgid ""
":ref:`RC9_OPTION <RC9_OPTION>` = 169 (\"Camera Auto Focus\") to trigger auto"
" focus"
msgstr ":ref:`RC9_OPTION <RC9_OPTION>` = 169（「Camera Auto Focus」）触发自动对焦"

#: ../../source/docs/common-topotek-gimbal.rst:58
#: caf444bee21a40ccb0f9432ae9ab0576
msgid "Configuring the Gimbal"
msgstr "配置云台"

#: ../../source/docs/common-topotek-gimbal.rst:64
#: 2d958bd49ad04c75984208e16fc996c7
msgid ""
"The camera gimbal can be configured over an Ethernet connection using the "
"\"GimbalControl\" application which can be downloaded from the `Topotek "
"Download Resources page <https://topotek.com/pages/TOPOTEK-Download-"
"Resources-11763444.html>`__"
msgstr ""
"可通过以太网连接使用「GimbalControl」应用程序配置摄像头云台，该应用可从 `Topotek 下载资源页面 "
"<https://topotek.com/pages/TOPOTEK-Download-Resources-11763444.html>`__ 下载"

#: ../../source/docs/common-topotek-gimbal.rst:66
#: 19205866d07b4caebc6ee3c974d89dca
msgid ""
"To configure using the serial port use the \"Angle control\" or \"Speed "
"control\" applications which can also be downloaded from `Topotek Download "
"Resources page <https://topotek.com/pages/TOPOTEK-Download-"
"Resources-11763444.html>`__"
msgstr ""
"通过串口配置请使用「Angle control」或「Speed control」应用程序，同样可从 `Topotek 下载资源页面 "
"<https://topotek.com/pages/TOPOTEK-Download-Resources-11763444.html>`__ 下载"

#: ../../source/docs/common-topotek-gimbal.rst:69
#: 51b9cf8f7b644f8aa1896c5436292170
msgid "Ethernet Connectivity"
msgstr "以太网连接"

#: ../../source/docs/common-topotek-gimbal.rst:71
#: 2d5b93b757024e53a8b59dbe6274c64a
msgid ""
"Instead of using a UART serial connection, an Ethernet connection may be "
"used to both control the gimbal and display live video stream from the "
"camera"
msgstr "除使用 UART 串口连接外，还可以使用以太网连接来控制云台并显示相机实时视频流"

#: ../../source/docs/common-topotek-gimbal.rst:77
#: f5d6a79a22f94cea877c071d36cbaf49
msgid ""
"An example setup of a networked ArduPilot vehicle system is detailed in "
":ref:`common-ethernet-vehicle`"
msgstr "网络化 ArduPilot 飞行器系统的示例设置详见 :ref:`common-ethernet-vehicle`"

#: ../../source/docs/common-topotek-gimbal.rst:79
#: 35c99ef758e347938c1a31be79b52eee
msgid ""
"Connect the gimbal and autopilot using an :ref:`ethernet adapter <common-"
"ethernet-adapters>`"
msgstr "使用 :ref:`以太网适配器 <common-ethernet-adapters>` 连接云台和飞控"

#: ../../source/docs/common-topotek-gimbal.rst:80
#: c857efda759943b986d35efcc8d99668
msgid ""
"Ensure the autopilot and gimbal are on the same subnet (e.g the first 3 "
"octets of the IP address match, 4th octet is different)"
msgstr "确保飞控和云台处于同一子网（例如 IP 地址前 3 个八位组相同，第 4 个不同）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-topotek-gimbal.rst:82
#: e70c9ec0cc6e46929ae1442017f4c7e5
msgid ""
"The gimbal's IP address can be set using the \"GimbalControl\" application "
"(see image above)"
msgstr "云台的 IP 地址可通过「GimbalControl」应用程序设置（见上图）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-topotek-gimbal.rst:83
#: 0c52d283fabd4af5ade04a48b78f13b0
msgid ""
"Set the autopilot's :ref:`NET_ENABLE<NET_ENABLE>` = 1 and reboot to enable "
"networking"
msgstr "将飞控的 :ref:`NET_ENABLE<NET_ENABLE>` 设为 1 并重启以启用网络"

#: ../../source/docs/common-topotek-gimbal.rst:84
#: d5c0211fe5a544d7bf2035bbc169ab55
msgid ""
"Set the autopilot's IP address using :ref:`NET_IPADDR0<NET_IPADDR0>`, "
":ref:`NET_IPADDR1<NET_IPADDR1>`, :ref:`NET_IPADDR2<NET_IPADDR2>`, "
":ref:`NET_IPADDR3<NET_IPADDR3>` (e.g. 192.168.144.14)"
msgstr ""
"使用 "
":ref:`NET_IPADDR0<NET_IPADDR0>`、:ref:`NET_IPADDR1<NET_IPADDR1>`、:ref:`NET_IPADDR2<NET_IPADDR2>`、:ref:`NET_IPADDR3<NET_IPADDR3>`"
" 设置飞控的 IP 地址（例如 192.168.144.14）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-topotek-gimbal.rst:86
#: 09f1a1a1cc034f2d896d817ea4b57536
msgid "Create a serial connection over ethernet"
msgstr "通过以太网创建串口连接"

#: ../../source/docs/common-topotek-gimbal.rst:88
#: 93f56ba576514ca4b5a5220f970466b4
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`NET_P1_TYPE<NET_P1_TYPE>` = 1 (UDP Client) and reboot the "
"autopilot"
msgstr "设置 :ref:`NET_P1_TYPE<NET_P1_TYPE>` = 1（UDP 客户端）并重启飞控"

#: ../../source/docs/common-topotek-gimbal.rst:89
#: 6807b9826c8d45838367a9ca8eaad6dc
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`NET_P1_IP0<NET_P1_IP0>`, :ref:`NET_P1_IP1<NET_P1_IP1>`, "
":ref:`NET_P1_IP2<NET_P1_IP2>`, :ref:`NET_P1_IP3<NET_P1_IP3>` to the gimbal's"
" IP address (e.g. 192.168.144.108)"
msgstr ""
"设置 "
":ref:`NET_P1_IP0<NET_P1_IP0>`、:ref:`NET_P1_IP1<NET_P1_IP1>`、:ref:`NET_P1_IP2<NET_P1_IP2>`、:ref:`NET_P1_IP3<NET_P1_IP3>`"
" 为云台的 IP 地址（例如 192.168.144.108）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-topotek-gimbal.rst:90
#: eab01349013949e8a322d8bec9b9eddd
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`NET_P1_PORT<NET_P1_PORT>` = 9003 (port that gimbal listens for "
"commands on)"
msgstr "设置 :ref:`NET_P1_PORT<NET_P1_PORT>` = 9003（云台监听命令的端口）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-topotek-gimbal.rst:91
#: aae3eafd945a4fad8db28ac032862510
msgid "Set :ref:`NET_P1_PROTOCOL<NET_P1_PROTOCOL>` = 8 (Gimbal)"
msgstr "设置 :ref:`NET_P1_PROTOCOL<NET_P1_PROTOCOL>` = 8（云台）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-topotek-gimbal.rst:93
#: ee6f299200b44dceadaff9f245cd3dde
msgid "Two video streams are available on different RTSP URLs"
msgstr "两路视频流可通过不同的 RTSP URL 获取"

#: ../../source/docs/common-topotek-gimbal.rst:95
#: d1f365f0cc7f4978a59254edf946d36b
msgid "\"rtsp://192.168.144.108:554/stream=0\" provides a 1080p stream"
msgstr "「rtsp://192.168.144.108:554/stream=0」提供 1080p 视频流"

#: ../../source/docs/common-topotek-gimbal.rst:96
#: 8eb3bbbc43c44064adcff50e411531f6
msgid "\"rtsp://192.168.144.108:554/stream=1\" provides a 480p stream"
msgstr "「rtsp://192.168.144.108:554/stream=1」提供 480p 视频流"

#: ../../source/docs/common-topotek-gimbal.rst:98
#: d7fa419937804750842c02160b04bd3e
msgid ""
"If connected to a PC, `VLC <https://www.videolan.org/>`__ can be used to "
"test the feed"
msgstr "如果连接到 PC，可使用 `VLC <https://www.videolan.org/>`__ 测试视频流"

#: ../../source/docs/common-topotek-gimbal.rst:100
#: afa57abede3644929f112ad6b282a408
msgid ""
"Set the PC's IP address so the first three octets match the camera's IP "
"address which, by default, is 192.168.144.108"
msgstr "将 PC 的 IP 地址设置为前三个八位组与相机 IP 地址匹配，相机默认 IP 为 192.168.144.108"

#: ../../source/docs/common-topotek-gimbal.rst:101
#: 2d2cac6169804e7b860c22be7b6643bd
msgid "Open VLC"
msgstr "打开 VLC"

#: ../../source/docs/common-topotek-gimbal.rst:102
#: af684aba3425490eaedcd91db8691c4b
msgid ""
"Select \"Media\", \"Open Network Stream\" and enter one of the RTSP URLS "
"listed above"
msgstr "选择「媒体」、「打开网络串流」，输入上方列出的某个 RTSP URL"

#: ../../source/docs/common-topotek-gimbal.rst:104
#: fe769ff4333847328e4b6f0028451c64
msgid ""
"If using QGC, the live video can be configured from the \"Application "
"Settings\", \"General\" screen.  Set \"Source\" to \"RTSP Video Stream\" and"
" \"RTSP URL\" to one of the RTSP URLs listed above"
msgstr ""
"如果使用 QGC，可在「应用程序设置」、「常规」界面配置实时视频。将「来源」设为「RTSP 视频流」，「RTSP URL」设为上方列出的某个 RTSP "
"URL"

#: ../../source/docs/common-topotek-gimbal.rst:106
#: 7e3a5c5fd39f47f98f15513cf678b735
msgid ""
"If using Mission Planner, the live video can be displayed on the Data screen"
" by following :ref:`these instructions <planner:live-video>`"
msgstr "如果使用 Mission Planner，可按照 :ref:`这些说明 <planner:live-video>` 在数据界面显示实时视频"

#: ../../source/docs/common-topotek-gimbal.rst:109
#: e1af12e1861a42c6b797299ae53f0414
msgid "Firmware Updates"
msgstr "固件更新"

#: ../../source/docs/common-topotek-gimbal.rst:111
#: 0a886e3ac4b04fbf8bd49894342426b4
msgid ""
"At least some Topotek gimbals support upgrading the firmware via SD card"
msgstr "至少部分 Topotek 云台支持通过 SD 卡升级固件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-topotek-gimbal.rst:113
#: a09a1c79ad894199820a368a99a417cd
msgid ""
"Email Topotek and request the latest firmware.  The email address can be "
"found at the bottom of the `topotek.com <https://topotek.com/>`__ website"
msgstr ""
"通过电子邮件联系 Topotek 索取最新固件。邮件地址可在 `topotek.com <https://topotek.com/>`__ 网站底部找到"

#: ../../source/docs/common-topotek-gimbal.rst:114
#: 8d50059761b5457daf827088db84d2b4
msgid "Eject the gimbal's SD card and insert it into a computer"
msgstr "弹出云台的 SD 卡并插入电脑"

#: ../../source/docs/common-topotek-gimbal.rst:115
#: 9c7d03e67c994b928fc9c22440e3fce7
msgid ""
"Copy the firmware into a file folder named \"topotek\" in the root directory"
" of the SD card"
msgstr "将固件复制到 SD 卡根目录下名为「topotek」的文件夹中"

#: ../../source/docs/common-topotek-gimbal.rst:116
#: 5fc8c92964764afabf289947b45d8c8f
msgid "Replace the SD card back into the gimbal"
msgstr "将 SD 卡重新插入云台"

#: ../../source/docs/common-topotek-gimbal.rst:117
#: d3a40eb3709841c28890bda887e4ff33
msgid "Powerup the Gimbal and it should update within 20 seconds"
msgstr "为云台上电，应在 20 秒内完成更新"

#: ../../source/docs/common-topotek-gimbal.rst:118
#: 71915f725bd84923b3b71306cc8f3c58
msgid ""
"Remove the SD card, delete the firmware file and reinsert the SD card into "
"the gimbal"
msgstr "取出 SD 卡，删除固件文件后将 SD 卡重新插入云台"

#: ../../source/docs/common-topotek-gimbal.rst:121
#: 6cca66bfb45744e3a6e07d3a21f4ba34
msgid "Downloading Images and Video"
msgstr "下载图片和视频"

#: ../../source/docs/common-topotek-gimbal.rst:123
#: 3eebc46bd4684ce2907ca98da8dffc32
msgid ""
"Images and videos captured by the camera gimbal can be remotely downloaded "
"via Ethernet"
msgstr "相机云台拍摄的图片和视频可通过以太网远程下载"

#: ../../source/docs/common-topotek-gimbal.rst:125
#: b18ffdfd5d04454f8bdefaba23c106c3
msgid "If a Windows PC is used:"
msgstr "如果使用 Windows PC："

#: ../../source/docs/common-topotek-gimbal.rst:127
#: c2e3cdc056ec445bb68d06b886826382
msgid ""
"Enable SMB file sharing support (`Microsoft instructions are here "
"<https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows-server/storage/file-"
"server/troubleshoot/detect-enable-and-disable-smbv1-v2-v3>`__)"
msgstr ""
"启用 SMB 文件共享支持（`微软说明文档在此 <https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows-"
"server/storage/file-server/troubleshoot/detect-enable-and-disable-"
"smbv1-v2-v3>`__）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-topotek-gimbal.rst:129
#: c35106c6087a457cac1544a32f193732
msgid "From the Start menu search for \"Turn Windows Features on or off\""
msgstr "在开始菜单中搜索「启用或关闭 Windows 功能」"

#: ../../source/docs/common-topotek-gimbal.rst:130
#: c786153aa935404abfd6ef5a1818ffeb
msgid "Enable \"SMB 1.0/CIFS File Sharing Support\""
